{
  "format": "uncertainty-calculations/project",
  "version": 1,
  "metadata": {
    "id": "ea402-s13-ring-gauge-temperature",
    "title": {
      "en": "Ring gauge calibration: temperature correction",
      "tr": "Halka mastar kalibrasyonu: sıcaklık düzeltmesi"
    },
    "description": {
      "en": "EA-4/02 S13: temperature sub-budget of the ring-gauge comparison; products of zero-mean temperature deviations with expansion coefficients.",
      "tr": "EA-4/02 S13: halka mastar karşılaştırmasının sıcaklık alt bütçesi; sıfır ortalamalı sıcaklık sapmalarının genleşme katsayılarıyla çarpımları."
    },
    "explanation": [
      {
        "en": "δl_T = [D_S(α_S − α_R) − D_X(α_X − α_R)]Δt_A + D_S α_S δt_S − D_X α_X δt_X + (D_S − D_X) α_R δt_R (µm), with D_S = 40 mm and D_X = 90 mm.",
        "tr": "δl_T = [D_S(α_S − α_R) − D_X(α_X − α_R)]Δt_A + D_S α_S δt_S − D_X α_X δt_X + (D_S − D_X) α_R δt_R (µm); D_S = 40 mm ve D_X = 90 mm."
      },
      {
        "en": "All temperature deviations have zero expectation, so the first term has zero first-order sensitivity; the second-order terms give the exact variance of the products: 0.018, 0.053, 0.12, 0.066 µm → u(δl_T) = 0.15 µm.",
        "tr": "Tüm sıcaklık sapmalarının beklenen değeri sıfırdır; bu nedenle birinci terimin birinci mertebe duyarlılığı sıfırdır; ikinci mertebe terimler çarpımların varyansını tam verir: 0,018, 0,053, 0,12, 0,066 µm → u(δl_T) = 0,15 µm."
      }
    ],
    "field": "length",
    "sources": [
      {
        "document": "EA-4/02 M:2022, Evaluation of the Uncertainty of Measurement in Calibration",
        "section": "S13",
        "url": "https://european-accreditation.org/wp-content/uploads/2018/10/EA-4-02.pdf"
      }
    ],
    "tags": [
      "ea-4/02",
      "calibration",
      "validation",
      "higher-order",
      "dimensional"
    ]
  },
  "model": {
    "output": {
      "name": "dl_T",
      "unit": "µm",
      "expression": "l_TA + l_TS - l_TX + l_TR",
      "description": {
        "en": "Temperature correction",
        "tr": "Sıcaklık düzeltmesi"
      }
    },
    "intermediates": [
      {
        "name": "l_TA",
        "expression": "(40000*(a_S - a_R) - 90000*(a_X - a_R))*dt_A"
      },
      {
        "name": "l_TS",
        "expression": "40000*a_S*dt_S"
      },
      {
        "name": "l_TX",
        "expression": "90000*a_X*dt_X"
      },
      {
        "name": "l_TR",
        "expression": "(40000 - 90000)*a_R*dt_R"
      }
    ],
    "inputs": [
      {
        "name": "a_S",
        "unit": "1/K",
        "description": {
          "en": "Expansion coefficient of the setting ring",
          "tr": "Ayar halkasının genleşme katsayısı"
        },
        "distribution": {
          "type": "rectangular",
          "value": 1.15e-05,
          "half_width": 1e-06
        }
      },
      {
        "name": "a_X",
        "unit": "1/K",
        "description": {
          "en": "Expansion coefficient of the ring gauge",
          "tr": "Halka mastarın genleşme katsayısı"
        },
        "distribution": {
          "type": "rectangular",
          "value": 1.15e-05,
          "half_width": 1e-06
        }
      },
      {
        "name": "a_R",
        "unit": "1/K",
        "description": {
          "en": "Expansion coefficient of the machine scale",
          "tr": "Makine skalasının genleşme katsayısı"
        },
        "distribution": {
          "type": "rectangular",
          "value": 1.15e-05,
          "half_width": 1e-06
        }
      },
      {
        "name": "dt_A",
        "unit": "K",
        "description": {
          "en": "Deviation of the mean temperature from 20 °C",
          "tr": "Ortalama sıcaklığın 20 °C'den sapması"
        },
        "distribution": {
          "type": "rectangular",
          "value": 0.0,
          "half_width": 0.5
        }
      },
      {
        "name": "dt_S",
        "unit": "K",
        "description": {
          "en": "Temperature difference, setting ring",
          "tr": "Sıcaklık farkı, ayar halkası"
        },
        "distribution": {
          "type": "rectangular",
          "value": 0.0,
          "half_width": 0.2
        }
      },
      {
        "name": "dt_X",
        "unit": "K",
        "description": {
          "en": "Temperature difference, ring gauge",
          "tr": "Sıcaklık farkı, halka mastar"
        },
        "distribution": {
          "type": "rectangular",
          "value": 0.0,
          "half_width": 0.2
        }
      },
      {
        "name": "dt_R",
        "unit": "K",
        "description": {
          "en": "Temperature difference, scale",
          "tr": "Sıcaklık farkı, skala"
        },
        "distribution": {
          "type": "rectangular",
          "value": 0.0,
          "half_width": 0.2
        }
      }
    ]
  },
  "analysis": {
    "gum": {
      "coverage_factor": 2,
      "higher_order": true
    },
    "mcm": {
      "trials": 1000000,
      "seed": 1
    }
  },
  "expected": {
    "gum": {
      "estimate": {
        "value": 0.0,
        "tolerance": 1e-12
      },
      "standard_uncertainty": {
        "value": 0.15,
        "tolerance": 0.005
      }
    },
    "reference": {
      "en": "EA-4/02 M:2022 S13.5 (u(δl_T) = 0.15 µm).",
      "tr": "EA-4/02 M:2022 S13.5 (u(δl_T) = 0,15 µm)."
    }
  }
}
